THE NARRATOR

The narrator is a synthetic voice, not a clone of any person's voice. Its identity
recording was generated from a text description of a voice with Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign
through mlx-audio and selected by the author; the reference recordings that the sample
film's casts name were spoken in that voice by the Qwen3-TTS Base model, which also
narrates both editions.

The sample film's listening-plan reading of "recording" is the CMUdict pronunciation,
Copyright (C) 1993-2015 Carnegie Mellon University, under its BSD-style license, and its
Chinese readings follow the macOS dictionaries.
